WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.860
- A leak of a draft opinion shows

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.010
that the Supreme Court is going

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:04.970
to formally overturn Roe v. Wade

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:07.050
and Planned Parenthood v. Casey.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:10.410
It is written by Justice Alito
joined by justices Thomas,

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.910
Gorsuch, Kavanaugh, and Barrett.

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:13.070
It appears to be legitimate

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:15.010
and there are no denials
from the Supreme Court.

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.120
Now, this draft may change.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.690
It's from February 10th.

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:18.970
There will be some negotiating

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:21.130
from the other justices
who will have some notes.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.870
Notably, Justice Roberts does not appear

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:23.990
to join in the decision.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.790
And while Roe and Casey
have been effectively dead

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:27.560
for months, this opinion would formally

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.120
and explicitly overturn those cases,

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.430
largely on the basis that the rights

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.087
granted by Roe and Casey are not, quote,

00:00:32.087 --> 00:00:34.310
"deeply rooted in the past jurisprudence

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:35.310
of American and British law."

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.290
So for a SCOTUS opinion, this
is stark and in your face.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:40.260
There are absolutely no punches pulled.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:41.130
But it remains to be seen

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:43.030
what the final version will look like.

